      "text": "This afternoon in Kigali, President Kagame met with Jack Ma, Founder of Alibaba Group, and Jerry Yang, Co-Founder of Yahoo, to discuss partnerships in entrepreneurship and innovation. Jack Ma and Jerry Yang are in Kigali for Africa’s Business Heroes (ABH), Alibaba’s flagship initiative supporting African entrepreneurs and job creation. The 7th edition Grand Finale, taking place today, brings together Africa’s most promising entrepreneurs, with the Top 10 finalists pitching their ventures for a share of USD 1.5 million in grant funding.",
